 251+ 4518              ; Obtain device status
 252+ 4518              ;
 253+ 4518              ;Output:  A = Status for the specified logical unit,
 254+ 4518              ;             or for the whole device if 0 was specified:
 255+ 4518              ;                0: The device or logical unit is not available, or the
 256+ 4518              ;                   device or logical unit number supplied is invalid.
 257+ 4518              ;                1: The device or logical unit is available and has not
 258+ 4518              ;                   changed since the last status request.
 259+ 4518              ;                2: The device or logical unit is available and has changed
 260+ 4518              ;                   since the last status request
 261+ 4518              ;                   (for devices, the device has been unplugged and a
 262+ 4518              ;                    different device has been plugged which has been
 263+ 4518              ;                    assigned the same device index; for logical units,
 264+ 4518              ;                    the media has been changed).
 265+ 4518              ;                3: The device or logical unit is available, but it is not
 266+ 4518              ;                   possible to determine whether it has been changed
 267+ 4518              ;                   or not since the last status request.
 268+ 4518              DEV_STATUS_ROMDISK:
 269+ 4518 3E 01            ld a, 1
 270+ 451A C9               ret
 271+ 451B
 272+ 451B              ; Obtain logical unit information
 273+ 451B              ;
 274+ 451B              ;Input:   HL = Pointer to buffer in RAM.
 275+ 451B              ;Output:  A = 0: Ok, buffer filled with information.
 276+ 451B              ;             1: Error, device or logical unit not available,
 277+ 451B              ;                or device index or logical unit number invalid.
 278+ 451B              LUN_INFO_ROMDISK:
