 814+ 4821              ; SNSMAT: Read the keyboard matrix
 815+ 4821              ;
 816+ 4821              ; This is the same SNSMAT provided by BIOS, it's copied here to avoid
 817+ 4821              ; having to do an interslot call every time it's used
