 115+ 4A92              ; Connect attached USB device and reset it
 116+ 4A92              ; Input: (none)
 117+ 4A92              ; Output: A = nr of connected USB devices, zero if none or error
 118+ 4A92              FN_CONNECT:
 119+ 4A92                  ; check of we already did a scan before
 120+ 4A92 CD FD 4A         call GET_USB_DEVICE_ADDRESS
 121+ 4A95 A7               and a
